'''Marching Kory''' (マーチン, ''Māchin'', '''Marchin''' or '''Martin''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[War on Valentines]]. He was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

