== Enemy==
Marching Kory is a yellow-ish koala who seems to be holding a cracker stick dipped in chocolate and covered with nuts, similar to a [[wikipedia:Pepero|Pepero]], and attacks by smashing it down. Looks like an angry version of [[Kory]]. With his constant, hard-hitting Area Attacks, Marching Kory can be treated as a [[Teacher Bun Bun]] with longer range but no abilities or traits.

==Strategy==
Though he has higher range than his variants, Marching Kory does not have [[Wave Attack]]s. This means meatshields are extremely useful against him. [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] outranges Marching Kory, so stack them in huge numbers to take him down! You can also use fast, hard-hitting units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to deal some quick damage and claim [[Timed Score Reward]]s. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat/Cyborg Cat]] outranges Marching Kory, so you can spam them as well, due to their low recharge time.

