==Trivia==
*Marching Kory is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Koala's March|Koala's March]] brand of cookies (also known as Koala Yummies), which have yellow koalas on their packaging.
**The significance of Marching Kory's original name, Martin, was lost in English; in Japanese it is pronounced ''Māchin'', which sounds almost like ''Māchi'' (March, as in Koala's March).
*His Japanese name was originally just Eccentric Koala (エキセントリックコアラ).
*He is currently the only variant of [[Kory]] to have no [[Wave Attack]]s.

